# The twelve rows, written here independently of the registry that produces them.
#
# Access and destructiveness decide whether a verification may run a command.
# Idempotency is stated too, and stated only so the suite can prove it is never
# consulted: two admissible rows are not intrinsically idempotent and neither is
# any refused row, so that column separates nothing this harness decides.
